{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31336","headline":"置酒 · 郑颢","name":"置酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒熟人须饮，春还鬓已秋。\n愿逢千日醉，得逭百年愁。\n卒卒周姬旦，栖栖鲁孔丘。\n平生能几日，不及且遨游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}